#appendix("D", "Solutions to the Exercises", label: <app-solutions>)

Every exercise in the book has a worked solution here and a complete,
tested version in the repository under `solutions/`. Exercises with
acceptance tests list them next to the exercise: copy those tests into your
own project, make them pass, and only then compare with the solution. A
solution is one good answer, not the only one; if yours passes the tests and
you can explain its trade-offs, it is correct.

